Discord Plus
Fork of the "discord" plugin v0.0.6 from claude-plugins-official (Anthropic),
licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0 (see LICENSE).

Changes from the original (2026-11-22):
- Renamed the plugin to "discord-plus" (package claude-channel-discord-plus). State dir moved to
  ~/.claude/channels/discord-plus/ so it does not clash with the official plugin. Skill references
  changed to /discord-plus:access and /discord-plus:configure.
- Channel, pairing and access-control logic unchanged.
- Added plus/ with 39 extra MCP tools (messages, members, server structure, webhooks, events,
  invites, audit log, presence, DMs to server members), an owner/admin gate for admin tools
  (owner id plus DISCORD_ADMIN_IDS), and an admin audit log (<state dir>/admin-audit.log).
- Added DM contacts: people the owner or an admin had the bot DM can reply to it without being added
  to the allowlist. Failed sends are reported to the owner.
- server.ts: small hooks only, each marked with a "discord-plus" comment: import, tool list, tool
  dispatch, MCP instructions, plus init, offering DMs to the contact handler before the unchanged
  gate, and noting the sender of each delivered message.
- Added tests/ (offline tests), .claude-plugin/marketplace.json (local marketplace), .gitignore.
- README.md rewritten for the fork.
- v0.3.0: DISCORD_OWNER_ID is required (no built-in owner); fail closed without it.
